      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Specifically the notifications for them. Everyone has to be verified by us to join our group so the on the spot notification does nothing but cause annoyance. We could just make the group Closed but then people would assume we aren't taking joiners and we'd have more trouble adding the people who do read instructions.",
