      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Please and thank you.\n\nThey fill up my notifications on some nights and my group has procedures to vet through Discord. Most times people just can't read, there's no way to message them, no way to go \"Hey we have a age requirement and or you need to do X\" . Yet whenever a Featured event is in the Calender the requests come in like crazy and I just want to enjoy the game and event I'm at, turn of the notifications for a bit, and turn then on later. I just want some privacy.",
